contentText:
Bunnie Xo is opening up about the harsh realities of heartbreak following her divorce from Jelly Roll , revealing in a conversation with Today &#8216;s Jenna Bush Hager on Open Book With Jenna that she resorted to eating baby food after the breakup wiped out her appetite.

